bove or below the season's mean in proportion to the other league's clubs; within its league a club stands (W% − ½ − f × Δ) ÷ ((1 − f) × n/(n − 1) + f) above its league's mean, f the share of its league's games that were interleague and n the clubs of its league; m 0.0242, the win share a point of strength is worth in the engine under 2010's rules. Every player of the club moves by one whole number and the best few of its lineup by one more, so nobody passes a teammate.","licence":"WAR: JEFFBAGWELL (Neil Paine), MIT. Names, birthplaces, clubs and ballparks: the Baseball Databank (Chadwick Baseball Bureau), CC BY-SA 3.0; its home games from Retrosheet. See public/baseball/ATTRIBUTION.txt.","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Neil-Paine-1/MLB-WAR-data-historical/1c8c3084d62112efdaa7054125af3cd01003e38d/jeffbagwell_war_historical_2025.csv","retrieved":"2026-11-10","rawScale":"WAR"},"map":"mlb2010","nations":{"124":[70,19,[["Russell Martin","C/3B",82],["George Kottaras","C",70],["Max St. Pierre","C",61],["Mike Nickeas","C",57],["Joey Votto","1B",91],["Justin Morneau","1B",90],["Jason Bay","LF",79],["Matt Stairs","LF/1B/RF",72],["Michael Saunders","LF/CF",67],["Adam Stern","CF",56],["Ryan Dempster","SP",81],["Rich Harden","SP",75],["Jeff Francis","SP",70],["Shawn Hill","SP",68],["John Axford","RP",78],["Jesse Crain","RP",76],["Blake Hawksworth","RP",67],["Chris Leroux","RP",63],["Scott Mathieson","RP",57]]],"158":[51,3,[["Chin-lung Hu","SS/2B",62],["Hung-Chih Kuo","RP",84],["Fu-Te Ni","RP",68]]],"170":[51,3,[["Orlando Cabrera","SS",76],["Edgar Renteria","SS",73],["Ernesto Frieri","RP",68]]],"192":[67,15,[["Brayan Pena","C",70],["Kendrys Morales","1B/RF",80],["Juan Miranda","1B",64],["Yonder Alonso","1B",64],["Dayan Viciedo","3B/1B",68],["Alexei Ramirez","SS/2B/CF",84],["Yunel Escobar","SS",82],["Yuniesky Betancourt","SS",69],["Livan Hernandez","SP",74],["Yunesky Maya","SP",63],["Jose Contreras","RP",75],["Aroldis Chapman","RP",69],["Danys Baez","RP",67],["Alberto Ca